This file contains list of all available parameters and the default
values used by Alliance Course Select Menu definition file.

This file IS NOT loaded by engine and should not be used as-is.
It's meant to be a reference for adding parameters to your own allianceCourses.def file.

 ____________________________
/      ALLIANCE COURSES      \_____________________________________________________

Load alliance courses assets.
Course items added are displayed in: Challenges - Alliance submenu.
Structure Hierarchy: [Course X] -> [Match X] -> [Route X] -> [Char X]

- [Course <0...>] (required)
Defines global settings and initialize an Alliance Course in the Alliance Select menu.

Setup following parameters below "[Course <0...>]" section:

- name = text (optional)
Set the name text that should be displayed for a course unlocked.

- ailevelstart = <0..8> (optional)
Sets the base AI level/difficulty for the course enemies.

- unlock (optional)
Pure Lua code, executed exactly as is, each time upon loading alliance mode
and after complete it. If it evaluates to boolean 'true' the alliance course
will be selectable from alliance mode submenu, or locked on 'false'.
Default: true.

- [Match <0...>] (required)
Defines a progressive stage within the selected Course.

- [Route <0...>] (required)
Defines a specific path choice within the current Match.

Setup following parameters below "[Route <0...>]" section:

- stage = path/file.def (optional)
Forces a specific stage to load for all fights in this route.
Note: The stage MUST be loaded in "select.def" file.
If left empty, the default stage assigned to the character will be loaded automatically.

- music = path/file.mp3 (optional)
Forces a specific song to load for all fights in this route.
If left empty, the default music assigned to the character will be loaded automatically.

- [Char <0...>] (required)
Defines the path and stats of an enemy slots (Up to 4 per route).

Setup following parameters below "[Char <0...>]" section:

- path = path (required)
Set Character Path to load for this route. (Need to be loaded in select.def).
set "randomselect" to pick a random opponent.

- life = <min, max> OR <fixed value> (required)
Sets the value to multiplies the character's maximum health constant (lifemax).
Supports a dynamic random range (e.g., 1, 15) or a single fixed integer.

- power = <min, max> OR <fixed value> (required)
Sets the initial Power Bar meter the character starts the match with.
Supports a dynamic random range (e.g., 1, 15) or a single fixed integer.

- attack = <min, max> OR <fixed value> (required)
Sets the damage output/attack scaling of the character.
Supports a dynamic random range (e.g., 1, 15) or a single fixed integer.

- defence = <min, max> OR <fixed value> (required)
Sets the value to increases the damage resistance scaling of the character.
Supports a dynamic random range (e.g., 1, 15) or a single fixed integer.
;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Some Examples:

[Course ]
name = NORMAL
ailevelstart = 1

[Match 1]

[Route 1]
stage = stages/Mountainside Temple/Lobby Night.def
music = sound/teambattle.mp3

[Char 1]
path = Kung Fu Man
life = 1,15
power = 1,15
attack = 1,15
defence = 1,15

[Char 2]
path = randomselect
life = 1,15
power = 1,15
attack = 1,15
defence = 1,15

[Char 3]
path = randomselect
life = 1,15
power = 1,15
attack = 1,15
defence = 1,15

[Char 4]
path = randomselect
life = 1,15
power = 1,15
attack = 1,15
defence = 1,15

